!!! 06-classes.matrix
!!! Nongeneric classes, inheritance, virtual dispatch and ancestor views.
!!!
!!! "my" is the receiver. Matrix synthesises the explicit first self parameter
!!! that Ny requires, so the NIL CALL_METHOD arity is identical.
!!!
!!! Equivalent Ny for the first two declarations:
!!!     abstract class Reader
!!!         pub abstract fn read(self) -> i32
!!!         end fn
!!!         pub fn relay(self) -> i32
!!!             return self.read() + 1
!!!         end fn
!!!     end class

book tour.readers

abstract Reader begin class

    !!! An abstract method has no body and therefore no begin/end pair.
    public abstract read-level returns number

    !!! A concrete helper on an abstract class may call an abstract method on
    !!! the receiver. It keeps its declaring owner's scope, but its virtual
    !!! call selects the dynamic override.
    public relay returns number begin paragraph
        give (my read-level with nothing) plus 1
    end paragraph
end class

ConstantReader inherits Reader begin class
    field level as number

    public replaces read-level returns number begin paragraph
        give my level
    end paragraph

    !!! No modifier means private to the declaring class.
    scaled returns number begin paragraph
        give my level times 2
    end paragraph
end class

OffsetReader inherits ConstantReader begin class
    field offset as number

    public replaces read-level returns number begin paragraph
        give my level plus my offset
    end paragraph
end class

!!! Multiple inheritance uses the actual concrete field layout, not an assumed
!!! first-base prefix. Ambiguous members are rejected.
!!! This member is deliberately NOT called 'label': Reader already declares
!!! one, and a class inheriting both would have an ambiguous inherited method,
!!! which Ny rejects rather than resolving by base order.
Tagged begin class
    field tag as text

    public tag-of returns text begin paragraph
        give my tag
    end paragraph
end class

TaggedReader inherits ConstantReader, Tagged begin class
    public replaces read-level returns number begin paragraph
        give my level
    end paragraph

    public identity returns text begin paragraph
        give my tag-of with nothing
    end paragraph
end class

!!! A Reader-typed parameter never becomes a derived type merely because a
!!! derived object was passed.
consume receives source as Reader returns number begin paragraph
    give source.relay with nothing
end paragraph

main returns number begin paragraph

    !!! Every construction initialises every inherited and local field exactly
    !!! once.
    value concrete is build ConstantReader with level being 41

    !!! An ancestor view changes the static view, not the dynamic class or the
    !!! field storage. There is no slicing and no implicit copy.
    value viewed as Reader is concrete

    say consume with source being viewed      !!! 42

    !!! Class values are shared handles, so the view observes the mutation.
    set concrete.level to 99
    say viewed.read-level with nothing              !!! 99

    value offset is build OffsetReader with level being 40, offset being 2
    value as_reader as Reader is offset
    say as_reader.read-level with nothing           !!! 42

    value sensor is build TaggedReader with level being 7, tag being "sensor"
    say sensor.read-level with nothing
    say sensor.identity with nothing

    give 0
end paragraph
